OL,3,GNEWSAMP concerned over extended crown
OL,4,Acourt closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP said it is a "huge
OL,7,Fdisappointment" that the Ministry of
OL,8,FJustice has still not repaired a crown
OL,9,Fcourt, meaning victims have to travel
OL,10,Fmiles for their hearings.
OL,12,FTaunton Crown Court at Shire Hall has
OL,13,Fbeen closed since 2023, after
OL,14,Fcontractors uncovered "serious
OL,15,Fstructural issues" with the flooring.
OL,17,FGideon Amos, Liberal Democrat MP for
OL,18,FTaunton and Wellington, said he will be
OL,19,Fputting pressure on the Ministry of
OL,20,FJustice to speed up the repairs as the
OL,21,Fissue is having "a massive affect on
OL,22,Fvictims, including victims of rape".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
